    "detailed_description": "<h1>Press Kit &amp; Fact Sheet</h1><p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/906d4269e3bca2f2e931cd01cf39c961.avif?t=1752083499\" /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/c7c633aa2eaf9fa4cb471514e26a7f53.avif?t=1752083499\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Mechanics:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/172157681a9b0005f21a1e21cfa562cc.poster.avif?t=1752083499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/172157681a9b0005f21a1e21cfa562cc.webm?t=1752083499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/172157681a9b0005f21a1e21cfa562cc.mp4?t=1752083499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6\ufe0fExplore biomes and battle monsters spawned from Mini the Dog\u2019s past life experiences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/22de57e69242e7627091a8bd225de8b4.poster.avif?t=1752083499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/22de57e69242e7627091a8bd225de8b4.webm?t=1752083499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/22de57e69242e7627091a8bd225de8b4.mp4?t=1752083499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6\ufe0fPetting your dog parries attacks and deflects projectiles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/6395c810b10661444cf1f35ebd583fea.poster.avif?t=1752083499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/6395c810b10661444cf1f35ebd583fea.webm?t=1752083499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/6395c810b10661444cf1f35ebd583fea.mp4?t=1752083499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6\ufe0fHit streaks activate Turbo and make your weapon super big and you super fast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/60e2bb7590caa733b533802814c1c7bc.poster.avif?t=1752083499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/60e2bb7590caa733b533802814c1c7bc.webm?t=1752083499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/60e2bb7590caa733b533802814c1c7bc.mp4?t=1752083499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u25b6\ufe0fEquip cards to gain skills and grow stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/0ca0bd0fccce67848bf46356c09a84b4.poster.avif?t=1752083499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/0ca0bd0fccce67848bf46356c09a84b4.webm?t=1752083499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/0ca0bd0fccce67848bf46356c09a84b4.mp4?t=1752083499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6\ufe0fCollect Mini\u2019s memories to uncover a past mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/9d1198fc7e20d36b7702462ae7c7941c.poster.avif?t=1752083499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/9d1198fc7e20d36b7702462ae7c7941c.webm?t=1752083499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/9d1198fc7e20d36b7702462ae7c7941c.mp4?t=1752083499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6\ufe0fDiscover the backstories of NPCs you meet in the present reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/21a40e9c96c96e578b721a78fff31bfa.poster.avif?t=1752083499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/21a40e9c96c96e578b721a78fff31bfa.webm?t=1752083499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/21a40e9c96c96e578b721a78fff31bfa.mp4?t=1752083499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6\ufe0fRevive Mini and craft her favourite items for her Cyber Paradise.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Story Overview</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a not-so-distant future, reality's been exposed as a mere computer simulation. Every aspect of life, from our appearance and possessions, to our thoughts and experiences, is pre-determined by algorithms. When we die, we are deleted; our life data fragmented and discarded into The Lost Sector. There's no heaven or hell, just hard, cold digits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, amidst the despair of this discovery, you seize the opportunity and turn it into a business - you found Cyber Paradise - a service scavenging the digital remains of the dearly departed in The Lost Sector and reassembling them within a digital sanctuary. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take on the role of Hayley, a skilled hacker-warrior, and team up with your dog DDmeow on this adventure. Vanquish monsters manifested by the deceased's fear and sorrow; uncover the mystery of your clients' pasts, and bond with the patrons within Mini's cafe that serves as your base. There, amid the hustle and bustle, catch a glimpse of this dystopian world through their shared stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the first episode, witness a heartfelt narrative through Mini-the-dog's memories as you mend the hearts left behind in the wake of her passing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/c7c633aa2eaf9fa4cb471514e26a7f53.avif?t=1752083499\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Mechanics:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/172157681a9b0005f21a1e21cfa562cc.poster.avif?t=1752083499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/172157681a9b0005f21a1e21cfa562cc.webm?t=1752083499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/172157681a9b0005f21a1e21cfa562cc.mp4?t=1752083499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6\ufe0fExplore biomes and battle monsters spawned from Mini the Dog\u2019s past life experiences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/22de57e69242e7627091a8bd225de8b4.poster.avif?t=1752083499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/22de57e69242e7627091a8bd225de8b4.webm?t=1752083499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/22de57e69242e7627091a8bd225de8b4.mp4?t=1752083499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6\ufe0fPetting your dog parries attacks and deflects projectiles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://share