The Lost Sector. There's no heaven or hell, just hard, cold digits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, amidst the despair of this discovery, you seize the opportunity and turn it into a business - you found Cyber Paradise - a service scavenging the digital remains of the dearly departed in The Lost Sector and reassembling them within a digital sanctuary. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take on the role of Hayley, a skilled hacker-warrior, and team up with your dog DDmeow on this adventure. Vanquish monsters manifested by the deceased's fear and sorrow; uncover the mystery of your clients' pasts, and bond with the patrons within Mini's cafe that serves as your base. There, amid the hustle and bustle, catch a glimpse of this dystopian world through their shared stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the first episode, witness a heartfelt narrative through Mini-the-dog's memories as you mend the hearts left behind in the wake of her passing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
